# README.md is NOT excluded: `pyproject.toml` declares `readme = "README.md"`, and the
# Dockerfile's builder stage COPYs it in because `uv sync` (hatchling) requires the file
# to exist to build the local project — excluding it breaks `docker build` entirely.
CLAUDE.md
